WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:05.464
(And now a special look at
Marvel Studios' original series Loki.)

00:00:07.157 --> 00:00:08.822
MOBIUS
Maybe Loki wants to mix it up,

00:00:08.822 --> 00:00:10.329
is that possible?

00:00:10.329 --> 00:00:11.560
To change?

00:00:12.016 --> 00:00:12.730
LOKI
Hi.

00:00:13.389 --> 00:00:15.389
JUDGE RENSLAYER
This variant is insubordinate.

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:17.434
Stubborn.

00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:19.264
Unpredictable.

00:00:19.264 --> 00:00:20.587
LOKI
Right on cue!

00:00:21.288 --> 00:00:22.672
MOBIUS
He's doing great.

00:00:22.881 --> 00:00:24.881
LOKI
You need the God of Mischief.

00:00:24.905 --> 00:00:26.610
MOBIUS
But he's really arrogant!

00:00:27.498 --> 00:00:28.695
LOKI
I am Loki!

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:32.007
And I am burdened
with glorious purpose.

00:00:32.753 --> 00:00:34.355
MOBIUS
Unbelievable! Wherever you go,

00:00:34.355 --> 00:00:37.980
it's just death, destruction,
 the literal ends of worlds.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:38.956
LOKI
I know.

